# BAB 3. Platform and Core APIs

## 3.1 Overview

Bab ini mendefinisikan kontrak REST domain **Platform/Core**: Organization, User, Security, Workflow, Master Data, dan Audit. Seluruh *resource* mengikuti **Standard Resource Operations** (BAB 2.6) dan standar lintas API (BAB 2). Hanya skema kunci dan aksi domain yang dirinci. Setiap resource memetakan ke tabel DBDD BAB 3.

---

## 3.2 Organization API — API-001

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/organizations` |
| Layanan | SVC-001 org-service |
| Tabel | `org.organization`, `org.organization_type` |
| Referensi | BR-001–006 (9.1) |

**Endpoint tambahan (di luar CRUD standar):**

| Method & Path                              | Deskripsi                                      |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `GET /v1/organizations/{id}/children`      | Anak langsung suatu organisasi.                |
| `GET /v1/organizations/{id}/tree`          | Subtree (Organization Tree) dari node.         |
| `POST /v1/organizations/{id}/activate`     | Transisi lifecycle → Active (BR-004).          |
| `POST /v1/organizations/{id}/archive`      | Transisi lifecycle → Archived.                 |
| `GET /v1/organization-types`               | Daftar tipe organisasi (API-002).              |

**Skema `Organization` (response):**

```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "code": "COMP-001",
  "name": "PT Contoh",
  "organizationTypeId": "uuid",
  "parentId": "uuid",
  "path": "/holding/subholding/comp-001",
  "status": "Active",
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01",
  "effectiveTo": null,
  "rowVersion": 3,
  "createdAt": "2026-01-01T08:00:00Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-02-01T09:00:00Z"
}
```

**Create request (`POST /v1/organizations`):** `code`, `name`, `organizationTypeId`, `parentId?`, `effectiveFrom`. Validasi: kode unik ber-scope (`409 ORG_CODE_DUPLICATE`, BR-005).

