## 3.3 User API — API-003

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/users` |
| Layanan | SVC-002 user-service |
| Tabel | `usr.app_user`, `usr.user_identity`, `usr.user_org_assignment` |
| Referensi | 9.2, INT-012 |

**Endpoint tambahan:**

| Method & Path                              | Deskripsi                                      |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `GET /v1/users/me`                         | Profil & scope pengguna terautentikasi.        |
| `GET /v1/users/{id}/assignments`           | Penugasan akses ber-scope pengguna.            |
| `POST /v1/users/{id}/assignments`          | Tambah penugasan (organization + role).        |
| `DELETE /v1/users/{id}/assignments/{aid}`  | Cabut penugasan.                               |

> Tidak ada endpoint *password* — autentikasi didelegasikan ke Identity Provider (INT-012, SAD BAB 7.3).

