## 3.5 Workflow API — API-005

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/workflow-definitions`, `/v1/workflow-instances` |
| Layanan | SVC-004 workflow-service |
| Tabel | `wf.workflow_definition/step/instance/task` |
| Referensi | 9.3, INT-004 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                                        | Deskripsi                                  |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `POST /v1/workflow-definitions`                      | Buat definisi alur (steps, approver rule). |
| `GET /v1/workflow-instances?documentRef=…`           | Cari instance per dokumen.                 |
| `GET /v1/workflow-tasks?assignee=me&status=Pending`  | Tugas approval pengguna.                    |
| `POST /v1/workflow-tasks/{id}/approve`               | Setujui tugas.                             |
| `POST /v1/workflow-tasks/{id}/reject`                | Tolak tugas.                               |
| `POST /v1/workflow-tasks/{id}/delegate`              | Delegasikan tugas.                         |

Keputusan approval memicu *event* `erp.workflow.approval.completed.v1` (BAB 7.3) ke modul asal dokumen.

