## 3.6 Master Data API — API-006 (Party), API-007 (Item)

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/parties` (customer/vendor), `/v1/items` |
| Layanan | SVC-005 masterdata-service |
| Tabel | `md.party`, `md.party_address`, `md.item`, `md.item_uom` |
| Referensi | 9.18, BO-010 |

**Skema `Party` (response, ringkas):**

```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "code": "CUST-0001",
  "name": "PT Pelanggan",
  "partyType": "customer",
  "taxId": "0123456789",
  "isShared": true,
  "rowVersion": 1
}
```

Perubahan master data menerbitkan `erp.masterdata.{customer,vendor,item}.upserted.v1` (Published Language, BAB 7.3) yang dikonsumsi modul lain.

