## 3.7 Audit API — API-008

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/audit-logs` |
| Layanan | SVC-018 audit-service |
| Tabel | `audit.audit_log` (read-only) |
| Referensi | BR-826–835 (9.20), NFR-018 |

**Endpoint (read-only, append-only source):**

| Method & Path                                                       | Deskripsi                          |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `GET /v1/audit-logs?entityType=journal_entry&entityId=…`            | Jejak audit per entitas.           |
| `GET /v1/audit-logs?actorId=…&occurredAt[gte]=…`                    | Aktivitas per pengguna & rentang.  |
| `GET /v1/audit-logs?correlationId=…`                                | Rekonstruksi alur lintas layanan.  |

Audit bersifat **read-only** via API (tidak ada create/update/delete); pencatatan terjadi otomatis via konsumsi event (SAD BAB 7.7).

---

## 3.8 Summary

Bab ini mendefinisikan kontrak REST domain Platform/Core: **Organization** (CRUD + traversal tree + lifecycle), **User** (profil, assignment ber-scope, tanpa password), **Security** (role/permission/scope), **Workflow** (definition/instance/task + aksi approve/reject/delegate), **Master Data** (party/item + event Published Language), dan **Audit** (read-only). Seluruh resource mengikuti standar BAB 2 dan memetakan ke tabel DBDD BAB 3 serta layanan SVC-001–005, 018.

